From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hannes Janetzek <hannes.janetzek@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:00:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] puredata engine: find the Organelle abstractions where
 zynthian-data isn't in /zynthian

Organelle patches declare zynthian's abstractions by their ZynthianOS path
(/zynthian/zynthian-data/puredata/organelle). Where the data directory is elsewhere
(desktop, distribution packages) pd didn't find clockfix, WCTL, ...; the engine adds
this system's directory to pd's search path (-path). Nothing changes on ZynthianOS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit a84c3f7f8be8bcec7a31965efea9abcf49dfcca9)
---
 zyngine/zynthian_engine_puredata.py | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/zyngine/zynthian_engine_puredata.py b/zyngine/zynthian_engine_puredata.py
index 22bf0633..ce844f0d 100644
--- a/zyngine/zynthian_engine_puredata.py
+++ b/zyngine/zynthian_engine_puredata.py
@@ -123,6 +123,12 @@ class zynthian_engine_puredata(zynthian_engine):
             self.base_command = f"pd -jack -nojackconnect -jackname \"{self.jackname}\" -rt -alsamidi -mididev 1"
         else:
             self.base_command = f"pd -nogui -jack -nojackconnect -jackname \"{self.jackname}\" -rt -alsamidi -mididev 1"
+        # Patches declare zynthian's Organelle abstractions by their ZynthianOS path
+        # (/zynthian/zynthian-data/puredata/organelle); where the data is elsewhere (desktop,
+        # distribution packages), add this system's directory to pd's search path
+        organelle_dir = f"{zynthian_paths.data_dir}/puredata/organelle"
+        if organelle_dir != "/zynthian/zynthian-data/puredata/organelle" and os.path.isdir(organelle_dir):
+            self.base_command += f" -path \"{organelle_dir}\""
 
         self.reset()
 
